  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></math> be the tetrahedron and position vectors&nbsp;of <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi></math> be <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> respectively.<br /><br />Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math><br /><br />Shortest distance <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> ... <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Also, volume <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></math> ... <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>200</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
